# CR 506.4/509.1h: a blocked creature remains blocked even if every
# creature blocking it is removed from combat. human attacks with Grizzly
# Bears; ai blocks with Hill Giant. In the declare blockers step human pays
# {4}{T} for Labyrinth of Skophos and removes the Giant from combat. The
# Bears stay blocked with no blocker (Java's AttackingBand keeps its blocked
# flag, Combat.removeFromCombat), so they deal no combat damage at all: ai
# stays at 20 and the Giant is undamaged.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 7=1
declareblockers
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 W
tapformana human 5 W
tapformana human 6 W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue targets 7
queue action human activate 2 1
passpriority
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
